      "releaseNotes": "Video recording is now available.\n\n- Capture videos with the app’s signature colors and compositions.\n\n9 new filters are now available.\n\n- Filter list: Neon City, Ruby City, Blue Mood, Purple City, Golden Plate, Peach Color, Milky Color, Sunshine Skin, Film Skin\n- From night scenes and food to everyday moments and portraits, choose a filter that fits each shot.\n\n5 new portrait compositions are now available.\n\n- We’ve also added composition guides that anyone can easily follow.\n- Use the guides to capture portraits that truly stand out.",
